"view.logtimescaleinput.help"              = "To find the position on the Logarithmic Time Scale for a specific event, select 'Positions for Event'. You will see the exact position as well as the aspects and midpoints to the radix.\n\nFor an overview of the logarithmic time scale throughout a lifetime, choose 'Overview'. You will see all positions by age.\n\nClick 'Calculate' to see the results.";

